 "definitions": {
  "counts_not_shares": "This page counts people. Every other industry page on this site measures the non-resident share of a field; here that share is near zero, so the number that matters is how many the country trains at all.",
  "award_levels": "Every level from a certificate under a year to a doctorate. IPEDS rollup rows (20, 21, 99) are excluded because they repeat the detail rows.",
  "first_major_only": "First-major rows only. A second-major row repeats a student already counted."
 },
